  "bio": "Laura de Baptistis is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Cologne, Germany, known for her exceptional work in traditional, illustrative, and dotwork styles. As the proud owner of Black Acid Tattoo and Blue Velvet Cosmetics, she maintains impeccable cleanliness in her studio at Ritterstr. 50, ensuring a safe and hygienic environment for all her clients. Laura's commitment to cleanliness is matched only by her artistic talent, making her a sought-after artist in the tattoo community.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Cologne, North-rhine-westphalia, Germany"
